 opportunity for them to come  and talk to you how they feel  and so when you get angry or frustrated  share that with your children letting  them know you know what  mom dad is angry i need some time to  cool off or  you know i really had a frustrating day  today and this is what i did  to let them know everything is not going  to be happy and rainbow and sunshine  and so in those moments when you can't  be happy and just kind of shake it off  this is what i do to ease the negativity  so just being open with them the general  theme i'm getting is just just be honest  with your kids and you have  you have a grounding exercise that  everyone can do what's this exercise  that you have for us  so think about your senses it's five  four three two one  five things that you physically see so  for you what are five things that you  see and you state them out loud  right now three yeah tell me i see devin  i see christian i see the news desk i  see mercedes getting ready for  momsplaining and i see you in front of  me  okay four things that you can feel  physically feel what are four things  that you feel  i feel my my ipad right here i feel my  suit jacket  my pants um i can feel my shoes  and i can feel my right microphone back  back there  okay what are three things that you hear  three things that i hear it's quiet on  the set someone talk i hear devin  telling me we got 30 seconds  i hear vanessa taking pictures and i  hear christian over there he's fiddling  with something so those are the three  things that i hear  all right two things that you can smell  two things i can smell i just did some  oyster shooters so i can smell the  oysters  and i can smell i can smell my hair  product  all right and then one thing that you  can taste i can still taste those  oysters  so that's real easy you're using your  senses five four three two one  five that you see four you feel three  you hear  two you smell and when you taste that is  great stuff thank you so much for  joining 